e:Lt(1322),Feeds:Lt(1579),Source:Lt(830),Triggers:Lt(1396),"Copy URI":Lt(704),Service:Lt(1526),"in the connector":Lt(779),Config:Lt(326),"double-click to open":Lt(608),"You changed «%s». Save before closing?":Lt(1026),tok:Lt(1286),"Discard this run?":Lt(1681),"You won't be able to resume it (the history stays).":Lt(1236),"Answer %s…":Lt(586),"Stop the run?":Lt(1053),"A safety snapshot was taken before each turn.":Lt(1364),"Talk to this agent (goes into its memory)…":Lt(1475),"Delete this chat":Lt(499),"This chat is part of %s's memory.":Lt(568),"the agent":"el agente",you:"vos",heavy:Lt(1652),"Turn failed":"El turno falló","Delete this chat?":Lt(1131),"It's also removed from the agent's memory.":Lt(528),"Delete chat":"Borrar chat",Live:"En vivo",Follow:"Seguir","Open its logs":Lt(1259),delegated:Lt(1202),replied:Lt(864),Entry:Lt(1500),Started:Lt(1294),Cost:"Costo",Result:Lt(335),"This run stopped halfway":"Este run se cortó a mitad de camino","You can pick it up where it left off.":"Lo podés retomar desde donde quedó.","Spend by agent":Lt(1312),"Delete this run?":Lt(424),"Its activity and logs are lost.":Lt(626),"API keys":Lt(1437),"Stored in this orchestrator's connector. Secrets are never shown again.":Lt(1659),"Import from the AI panel":"Importar del panel de IA","Add key":Lt(430),"Leave empty to keep %s":Lt(470),"Base URL":"URL base",Provider:Lt(1304),"Delete key «%s»?":Lt(1344),"It's removed from this orchestrator's connector.":Lt(565),"Heavy memory: consider clearing it from the chat.":Lt(271),"No AI — assign":Lt(1517),"(no folder)":Lt(1541),Off:Lt(1143),MCP:"MCP","The agent can look, never change anything.":Lt(793),"The agent can read and modify it.":Lt(1649),"Edit, plus run things: commands on a folder, fetches on an object project.":Lt(1015),"asks you":Lt(1700),waiting:"esperando",queued:Lt(1367),log:Lt(1496),asked:"preguntó",final:"final",spend:Lt(1183),"Zoom to arrow":Lt(1129),Direction:Lt(1457),Nondirectional:Lt(1069),Unidirectional:"Unidireccional",Bidi